{"scope":"Informed nonauthor witness audit, original author EM-DIRECT-970E1C; no native admission.","source":"37ea7118715feab970a943d0deacfb164e912eb8:research_notes/portable_direct/riesel_r4_eighteen_sharp_20261125/reproduction.json","method":"Global W(h/gcd(h,35))<=13; branch W(h/gcd(h,L))<=k-1; integer capacity filter with exact BigInt common scale. For each candidate h0 and representative private x in D, enumerate all surviving-period residue masks not covering x, on finite witnesses inside D mod L and outside h0 class. Allow duplicate-period classes and ignore prime-stock limits (relaxation). Contained masks can be replaced by supersets; sum of largest slots remaining intersections bounds any union. DFS branches on all maximal masks containing an uncovered point. Caps only throw or lead to inconclusive, never exclusion. Final finite witnesses encoded sorted deltas in base36 separated by dots; decode by cumulative addition, first delta from zero. Reproducible function below. Author expected counts 962,104,39.","reproduce_js":"function audit(targets) {\n const B=[0,3,5,8,10,15,21,23,26,28,30,31,33], F0=[[2,1],[3,1],[4,2]], R0=[0,1,2,3,5], ps=[2,3,5,7,11,13];\n const gcd=(a,b)=>b?gcd(b,a%b):a, lcm=(a,b)=>a/gcd(a,b)*b;\n function factors(n){const a=[];for(let p=2;p*p<=n;p++)if(n%p===0){let e=0;while(n%p===0){n/=p;e++}a.push([p,e]);}if(n>1)a.push([n,1]);return a;}\n const W=n=>factors(n).reduce((s,[p,e])=>s+e*(p-1),0);\n const M=[];function gen(i,m,b){if(i===ps.length){M.push(m);return;}for(let p=ps[i];b>=0;b-=p-1,m*=p)gen(i+1,m,b);}gen(0,1,13);\n const H=[...new Set(M.flatMap(m=>[1,5,7,35].map(g=>m*g).filter(h=>h/gcd(h,35)===m)))].filter(h=>h>=9&&h!==10).sort((a,b)=>a-b);\n const scale=M.map(BigInt).reduce(lcm,1n), max=a=>a.reduce((x,y)=>x>y?x:y,0n);\n function inv(a,m){let [r,s,x,y]=[a,m,1n,0n];while(s){const q=r/s;[r,s]=[s,r-q*s];[x,y]=[y,x-q*y];}if(r!==1n)throw Error(\"inverse\");return (x%m+m)%m;}\n function pop(x){let c=0;while(x){x&=x-1n;c++;}return c;}\n const rows=[],witnesses=[];\n for(let f=0;f<8;f++)for(let r=0;r<32;r++){\n   const F=F0.filter((_,i)=>f>>i&1), R=R0.filter((_,i)=>r>>i&1), k=14-F.length-R.length,L=F.reduce((n,[m])=>lcm(n,m),35);\n   const D=Array.from({length:L},(_,x)=>x).filter(x=>B.includes(x%35)&&!R.includes(x%7)&&!F.some(([m,b])=>x%m===b));if(!D.length)continue;\n   const C=H.flatMap(h=>{const g=gcd(h,L),m=h/g,w=W(m);if(w>k-1)return [];const a=Array(g).fill(0);for(const x of D)a[x%g]++;if(scale%BigInt(m)!==0n)throw Error(\"scale\");const cap=BigInt(Math.max(...a))*scale/BigInt(m);return cap?[{h,m,w,cap}]:[];});\n   const best=max(C.map(x=>x.cap)),cache=new Map;function at(z){if(!cache.has(z))cache.set(z,max(C.filter(x=>x.m%z===0).map(x=>x.cap)));return cache.get(z);}\n   const hs=C.filter(x=>{let s=x.cap+BigInt(k-1-x.w)*best;for(const [p,e]of factors(x.m))for(let j=1;j<=e;j++)s+=BigInt(p-1)*at(p**j);return s>=BigInt(D.length)*scale;}).map(x=>x.h);\n   const selected=targets.filter(h=>hs.includes(h));if(!selected.length)continue;\n   const Pbig=hs.map(BigInt).reduce(lcm,BigInt(L));if(Pbig>BigInt(Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER))throw Error(\"unsafe P\");const P=Number(Pbig),fp=new Map(factors(P)),fl=new Map(factors(L));\n   for(const h0 of selected){let closed=0,nodes=0,rounds=0,maxPts=0;\n     for(const x of D){const points=new Set;const add=n=>{if(n%h0!==x%h0)points.add(n);};\n       for(const [p,e]of factors(h0)){const pe=BigInt(p)**BigInt(fp.get(p)),other=Pbig/pe,crt=other*inv(other%pe,pe);for(let i=fl.get(p)??0;i<e;i++)for(let a=1;a<p;a++)add(Number((BigInt(x)+crt*BigInt(a)*BigInt(p)**BigInt(i))%Pbig));}\n       for(let j=0;j<3;j++)for(const d of D)add(d+j*L);\n       let done=false;\n       for(let round=0;round<12;round++){rounds++;const pts=[...points],N=pts.length;maxPts=Math.max(maxPts,N);if(pts.some(n=>!Number.isSafeInteger(n)||!D.includes(n%L)||n%h0===x%h0))throw Error(\"invalid witness\");\n         const masks=new Map;\n         for(const h of hs){const groups=new Map;for(let i=0;i<N;i++){let b=pts[i]%h;if(b===x%h)continue;groups.set(b,(groups.get(b)??0n)|(1n<<BigInt(i)));}for(const [b,m]of groups)if(!masks.has(m))masks.set(m,[h,b]);}\n         const O=[...masks].map(([m,hr])=>({m,hr,n:pop(m)})).sort((a,b)=>b.n-a.n),maximal=[];for(const o of O)if(!maximal.some(z=>(z.m&o.m)===o.m))maximal.push(o);\n         const by=pts.map((_,i)=>maximal.filter(o=>o.m&(1n<<BigInt(i)))),failed=new Set;let nNodes=0;\n         function dfs(todo,slots){if(++nNodes>1000000)throw Error(\"node cap\");if(!todo)return [];if(!slots)return null;const rem=pop(todo),bounds=maximal.map(o=>pop(o.m&todo)).sort((a,b)=>b-a);if(bounds.slice(0,slots).reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0)<rem)return null;const key=slots+\":\"+todo;if(failed.has(key))return null;let opts=null;for(let i=0;i<N;i++)if(todo&(1n<<BigInt(i)))if(opts===null||by[i].length<opts.length)opts=by[i];for(const o of opts??[]){const res=dfs(todo&~o.m,slots-1);if(res!==null)return [o.hr,...res];}failed.add(key);return null;}\n         const cover=dfs((1n<<BigInt(N))-1n,k-1);nodes+=nNodes;\n         if(cover===null){closed++;done=true;const sorted=pts.slice().sort((a,b)=>a-b);witnesses.push({f,r,h:h0,x,nodes:nNodes,delta36:sorted.map((v,i)=>(v-(i?sorted[i-1]:0)).toString(36)).join(\".\")});break;}\n         if(cover.length>k-1||cover.some(([h,b])=>x%h===b)||pts.some(n=>!cover.some(([h,b])=>n%h===b)))throw Error(\"cover verification\");cover.push([h0,x%h0]);\n         const before=points.size;outer:for(let j=0;j<100000;j++)for(const d of D){const n=j*L+d;if(!cover.some(([h,b])=>n%h===b)){add(n);if(points.size>=before+8)break outer;}}\n         if(points.size===before)break;\n       }\n       if(!done)throw Error(\"inconclusive \"+[f,r,h0,x]);\n     }rows.push({f,r,L,k,h:h0,P,periods:hs.length,cases:D.length,closed,rounds,nodes,maxPts});\n   }\n }\n const totals=targets.map(h=>{const s=rows.filter(x=>x.h===h);return {h,branches:s.length,cases:s.reduce((a,b)=>a+b.cases,0),closed:s.reduce((a,b)=>a+b.closed,0),rounds:s.reduce((a,b)=>a+b.rounds,0),